WEBVTT

00:03:59.603 --> 00:04:01.171
wearing my hair longer,

00:04:01.204 --> 00:04:03.140
using the single-stall girls' bathroom,

00:04:03.173 --> 00:04:06.243
followed in fifth grade
by the multistall girls' bathroom,

00:04:06.276 --> 00:04:07.511
wearing skirts,

00:04:07.544 --> 00:04:10.113
and finally, using my name, Nicole.

00:04:11.615 --> 00:04:14.618
What I really liked
about the gradual transition

00:04:14.651 --> 00:04:16.953
was that everyone was cooperating,

00:04:16.953 --> 00:04:19.122
and it put no strain
on the other students,

00:04:19.122 --> 00:04:21.224
because they were all
eased into it with me.

00:04:22.025 --> 00:04:23.727
Everything was perfect.

00:04:25.262 --> 00:04:26.863
Until in fifth grade ...

00:04:28.865 --> 00:04:30.967
A student who had moved there
the year before